: "5.png", "id": "429777488273836", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210884_429777491607169_8716825292085708675_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vHpYmy87uB0Q7kNvwETSwCJ&_nc_oc=Adpc4zks5wRSRZZmTLLcALZK0xJxc4iz27O4Z8blZDKRi96rnoHhs2YTHz_czfNtW_A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSog8-hBAgiBAH9la0fyHZSij0YgGswv-yhZVi1P63AVg&oe=6B05C01E"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "425967098635508", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458089_425967101968841_7573424558178569741_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TE4hSy6gGdQQ7kNvwGZlZ0j&_nc_oc=AdopelTpGebbU5HnEQB8eSj1OwVvrRYbWqWgW9kyeSNzMVouR5VJpPdiLfZ9JD8feOY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTFKh5TfjwXObBZgT41b0plqaVkZUBEUwwEh6NKQ-AD7g&oe=6B05C60C"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "222765492631957", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031465_222765495965290_212792495828102734_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2874zEUFjNQQ7kNvwEGJGmX&_nc_oc=AdoHuxH68mxG6kbuS3F28BRxM0Hxow8AgDC_Jsk6A4DZUq2XwTZtRCBI7dn-vNTRIUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTsTor6MZMlGreF3a788EnNWQyoejNS8z5VXkm0H7InRw&oe=6B05C78F"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "169433328311430", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982653_169433331644763_6500055822036622297_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4ll5X7H09-oQ7kNvwGUXALQ&_nc_oc=AdouVVIOsk2L5wTs4reicTDU8yKrsAFo0yrz0mC8lCHugFFolCnDuuNPp1-LY1tSnu8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTlJfEZ8tnVmyfbEGtvApBjYdernsyUwNIuwyjSKH0fVA&oe=6B05AF58"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image.png", "id": "117521453594753", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974535_117521456928086_99350484779883293_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=phJr_LCO1SIQ7kNvwG27Wkw&_nc_oc=AdpCOAheIjXnPWeS3dNmJaeIybKpJJgJbgKvkhvp92EiFtRn6CkiSoR1uI3CYfi_zdM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTUtujnZLHXXKWzXsLlRomw5UnQMd2FAPkIDnoZBrPZqQ&oe=6B05A98C"}, "display_name": "SENTIO VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SENTIO VR is the preferred platform for professionals working in the Architecture, Engineering & Construction Industry in 100+ countries. How does a project that has not yet been built look like? Instead of reviewing 2D floorplans, renders & video walkthroughs - SENTIO VR customers put on an Oculus Quest headset for real-time feedback with clients, improved designs & win new projects.\n\nHere are the key features that make SENTIO VR stand out:\n\n1) Plugins for SketchUp & Autodesk Revit\n- No downloads or upload of files needed. Works with your existing design tools\n\n2) No additional downloads\n- No additional PC software is required to manage the model upload process. \n\n3) Intuitive VR meetings\n- Multi-user collaboration meetings have never been easier using access codes & passwords\n\nHave questions? Reach out to us at hello@sentiovr.com", "short_description": "Want to view a construction project before it's built? With SENTIO VR, multiple stakeholders in a project can meet virtually, voice-chat & collaborate over a 3D model enabling better decisions.\n\nSupports SketchUp, Revit & 360 panoramas.\n\nNeed some inspiration? Explore a unique collection of 360 experiences of architectural spaces curated by ArchDaily & our content team.\n\nNote: \n-Permission for Microphone is needed for VR meetings\n-Permission for Device files is needed for downloading 3D models"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qFROWZPNG97M6dEBbC4k0YLRcanJt7Q98sCi56HR6MI/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SENTIO VR"